2. On-page optimisation: for every crawled page give a score (0-100), the issues found in the data (title/meta length, H1 count, missing alt text, thin content, missing schema, canonical, hreflang, OG tags, internal links) and rewrite the title (50-60 chars), meta description (140-155 chars) and H1 around the best keyword.
3. Technical SEO checks: robots.txt, XML sitemap, HTTPS, mobile viewport, Core Web Vitals (LCP, CLS, INP/TBT), compression, canonicalisation, indexability, structured data, hreflang/RTL for Arabic. Status pass / warning / fail with a concrete fix.
